        apply for a beta tester job!

  + This program provides a very simple and easy way for visiting
    sysops to leave an Ad for their BBS or for callers to view
    the list of Advertised systems.

  + This program is very straight forward and easy to use.

                &&&&&&&&&&& Attention &&&&&&&&&&

     This version has error capturing routines in the event
    a caller puts no data (or Bogus data) in his entry for a
    new BBS. Of course there is no way to keep real odd balls from
    entering fake phone numbers, dirty words and stuff like that.
    You should check the info from time to time.

                &&&&&&&&&&&&&&&&&&&&&&&&&&&&&&&&


                        ||   SETUP   ||

  This program comes with it's own setup utilty, "Install.rexx"
  This Arexx script will both Install and update earlier versions
  of BBS Advertiser. I stongly suggest you use the install program!
  It makes the job very quick and easy! Simply decompress this
  archive directly to RAM and open a shell and type rx RAM:install
  And Obviuosly, you need to have Arexx running. If not, type "rexxmast"
  in a shell window or add it to your startup-sequence.

  I have supplied Doc files for those of you who wish to install
  BBS Advertiser manually.

  For BBBBS setup instructions, look inside the "BBBBS" directory
  in this archive.

  For DLG setup instructions, look inside the "DLG" directory
  in this archive.

  For Cnet setup instructions, look inside the "Cnet" directory
  in this archive.

  For Trinity setup instructions, look inside the "Trinity" directory
  in this archive

